form part or process of various animals. See cut under ''hydranth''.—'''2.''' In ''bot.'', one of the long, straight, and soft hairs which sometimes cover the fruit, flowers, and other parts of plants.—{{smaller|'''Arachnoidal villi''', the Pacchionian bodies or glands.—'''Intestinal villi.''' See def. 1.}}

